{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "335ff08a65d318a10deb052064cc29cf07168d0a865b4c2317093d41b108aea4", "ja": "（前の現場が押しに押して、雪歩はリハーサルなしで\nライブに出ることになってしまった……）", "zh": "（之前的拍摄现场一再延误，结果雪步不得不不经过彩排就登台演出……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1001_p", "source_sha256": "898acaff191489db14b57e4b2c3e3e423694ae2875cd4eed84e543908d1639fd", "ja": "すまない、雪歩！　ぶっつけ本番になる。\nだけど、いつも通りにやれば大丈夫だからな！", "zh": "对不起，雪步！这次要直接上场了。\n不过，按平时那样来就没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0ee1ddbc9cbd1533fb490d659fa0ae0239ba76f8bb37d3757bc9155e42be7084", "ja": "{$P$}……ううっ。\nそう言われても、やっぱり緊張しちゃって……。", "zh": "{$P$}……呜呜。\n就算你这么说，我还是会紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c9afa8582bbe46e0ae8554de0a24403253449d6e6ede0fced91793ab6340d550", "ja": "そ、そうだ！　こういう時はお茶ですよね！\n落ち着くためにお茶を……。", "zh": "对、对了！这种时候就该喝茶了！\n为了冷静下来，先泡杯茶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "343507c5f3c58ae0680492f754afe047a1ed0405832c0b782777e7758438e7c0", "ja": "あ、あうう、淹れてる時間がないですぅ！\nはううっ、ど、どうしたら……。", "zh": "啊、啊呜呜，没时间泡茶了啦！\n呜呜，怎、怎么办才好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9bd53ab222417f0473c1bd07546896effcf35bb9881608f32b6177a03d2be9ba", "ja": "雪歩、ひとまず深呼吸だ。\nゆっくり、息を吸って、吐いて……。", "zh": "雪步，先深呼吸一下。慢慢地，吸气，再呼气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4ad01b4b885bd0f494d20d73d937cf6f6c5056a6b90d0340e0f079ceef970c96", "ja": "は、はい。ゆっくり息を……。\nす、すう、はあ……。", "zh": "好、好的。慢慢呼吸……\n吸、吸……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5c42fa44cb3b39ccf03ad17e69354569d956d5cca5e10ec0bca66c964a5ebc70", "ja": "気楽に、リラックスしよう。何かこう、\n楽しかったことでも、思い浮かべて……。", "zh": "放轻松，别紧张。想点什么呢，\n比如，回忆一下开心的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "869580239279ac0e822ba1bcb46f77c7b521fcf99380cb514d26337d16f7138b", "ja": "リラックス……楽しかったこと……ええと。\n……あ！　ふふふっ♪", "zh": "放松……开心的事……嗯……\n……啊！呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1009_p", "source_sha256": "502003443ef1e25eedf698b3ae03c969903cbdb988387ea54de88caa857475e8", "ja": "ん？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6d887699eead16b9115dc7d9c952c533603cb98766f7112cb8bf2343e851e954", "ja": "ふふっ……昨日のロケのこと、思い出しちゃって。\nすっごく綺麗な冬景色だったのに……。", "zh": "呵呵……我想起昨天外景拍摄的事了。\n明明是美得不得了的冬日景色……佤", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e73dcaa65831b8a883118e6e930a4e7290f5ed3ffec83e5f24b06369e643b5c9", "ja": "{$P$}のくしゃみで、\n枝の雪がどさどさー、って落ちちゃって……♪", "zh": "因为{$P$}打了个喷嚏，\n树枝上的雪就哗啦啦地全落下来了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c0f8031638458e3549839fd8ccf0df39bd031530f0d939cee2a19f6beaa4f144", "ja": "ああ、あれか。俺たちの上に雪がドッサリ積もって……\nごめんごめん、雪歩も冷たかったよな？", "zh": "啊，是那件事啊。积在我们头上的雪哗啦啦地掉下来……  \n抱歉抱歉，雪步也觉得冷吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c09cd9d92fdf45993cb8e3e6d5f510dd698277e26e4f91f0f776a5664010d6c1", "ja": "いえっ、ちょっとだけ、ビックリしましたけど……。\nでも、なんだかすごく面白かったなぁって♪", "zh": "不，只是稍微吓了一跳……  \n不过，总觉得特别有意思呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1014_p", "source_sha256": "810a64accec9c30053691ed39ab156029de7a7a187a07c8fd1a97fe03c7bf63c", "ja": "そうか、それならいいんだ。\nさて、そろそろ出番だけど、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。差不多该上场了，你没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f671da1a98432f056c1dfd5784f80ea6720e705d94fbc8db8227a1ad8a956c34", "ja": "え？　……あ、そうでした！\n……あれっ？　なんだか私、落ち着いてるかも……？", "zh": "诶？……啊，对哦！\n……咦？总觉得我好像很冷静……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1016_p", "source_sha256": "290bd40702bd9140bb4befe84f4dca87ebd97c3a640ed909114987fe11323c80", "ja": "おっ、そうか。それならよかった！", "zh": "哦，这样啊。那就太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "56dfd46ecde764cecb8809af9ea5a09ef609fa087a79684a5c4fd73f9b624f69", "ja": "えへへ。これって、{$P$}の\nくしゃみのおかげですよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿。这都是托{$P$}打喷嚏的福，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b6ae0b4e513fbe6303ee2fcb8705e65b54a37fe1b59326cd1b5af7e889e57f4e", "ja": "私も見習って、今日は思いっきり、大きな声を出して\n……みんなの笑顔のきっかけ、つくってみますね。", "zh": "我也学学你的样子，今天会尽情大声喊出来……试着成为让大家绽放笑容的契机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7d87e293172454d6e8f5d4a025a2a4a24fd45f849df87820e382cc5f66dfb0ea", "ja": "はは、くしゃみを見習うってのも、変な話だけど……。\nともあれ、任せたよ。しっかりな！", "zh": "哈哈，要学打喷嚏也是件怪事，不过……\n总之，就交给你了。好好加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0d159a4a03b8b3491f3270dc2772169883701afca006a31702ee4ce25dff51c6", "ja": "はいっ！　すう……はあ……。\n{$P$}。それじゃあ、行ってきます！", "zh": "好的！吸气……呼气……\n{$P$}先生，那我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0144_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6dcbc2bda7f1d95c9a2d4ed01e517c0cece9de2a30fc7ab80914935335f4be32", "ja": "（ステージに向かう雪歩の足取りからは、\n力強さが感じられた……これなら、いけそうだな！）", "zh": "（从走向舞台的雪步脚步中，\n能感受到一股力量……这样应该没问题了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
